translate fr qst_dreamhouse_numa_talk_menu_b043dfff:

    # NUMA @ think "I remember him being particularly interested in texts about dreams and dark magecraft."
    NUMA @ think "Je me souviens qu'il s'intéressait particulièrement aux textes sur les rêves et la magie noire."

