translate fr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_e99e910f:

    # "As the fingers dropped to the floor, the ghoulish creature turned towards us, placing down a platter of the man's remains on the table,"
    "Alors que les doigts tombaient au sol, la créature macabre se tourna vers nous, posant un plateau contenant les restes de l'homme sur la table,"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:941
translate fr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_b108b59f:

    # "it then stared blankly towards us, expectantly."
    "puis elle nous fixa d'un regard vide, dans l'expectative."

